lvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">美团正式推出AI健康管理产品“小团健康管家”入局医疗赛道</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微软Edge浏览器下月升级管控功能，强制拦截第三方AI并引导至Copilot</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Adobe发布Firefly AI Assistant创作智能体，实现跨应用自主工作流调度</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果启动内部AI编程训练营，强化Siri大模型工程能力以实现AI助理转型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/cf14f2030f6c7ab1f5117bbe659e7142.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果公司近期面向Siri工程师团队启动内部“AI编程训练营”，旨在通过系统性再培训强化LLM工程实践能力，为新一代Siri及iOS系统AI功能落地提供人才支撑。该训练营涵盖模型原理、Prompt工程、RAG、AI Agent框架及低延迟推理优化等全链路技术栈。课程重点强调端云协同与离线推理技术，要求工程师在隐私安全框架下，实现Siri与Spotlight、通讯录及日历等系统级应用的深度耦合。此举标志着苹果将AI重塑Siri提升至公司级战略，力图将Siri从单一指令工具演进为具备多模态交互、能处理复杂上下文的“真·AI个人助理”。通过此次内部技术底层迭代，苹果正加速AI技术在设备控制、知识问答及生产力创作场景的渗透，推动Siri完成从语音插件向系统底层AI核心的本质跨越。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯开源混元 3D 世界模型 2.0，支持生成可编辑资产并对接游戏引擎</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5d5711e603478049850b4580aaef76b4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯正式发布并开源混元 3D 世界模型 2.0（HY-World2.0），该模型具备多模态能力，支持通过文本、图片或视频输入，自动生成、重建及模拟 3D 世界。相比 1.5 版本，HY-World2.0 核心升级在于支持生成可二次编辑的 3D 资产，并兼容 Mesh、3DGS 及点云等多种格式，可直接导入 Unity 和 UE 等主流游戏引擎，显著降低了游戏地图与关卡原型的创作门槛。此外，该模型支持通过视频或多视角图片复刻高精度数字孪生空间，并集成空间 Agent 技术与导航算法，可智能规划漫游轨迹。开发者可通过 GitHub 获取开源代码，或在官方平台申请体验，利用该模型快速实现从创意描述到 3D 场景的自动化构建。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">美团正式推出AI健康管理产品“小团健康管家”入局医疗赛道</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2b8750dbc4132ae01e15c6a5a118de64.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">4月14日，美团正式推出聚焦家庭健康管理的AI产品“小团健康管家”，标志着美团全面入局AI医疗赛道。该产品依托美团现有的药物即时配送基础设施，将低频的健康管理需求与高频的本地生活服务生态深度整合。美团此前已通过旗下基金投资深纳普思、参与智冉医疗融资，并与荣泰健康在智能理疗领域开展合作，多线构建AI医疗生态。美团的核心竞争优势在于其覆盖数亿用户的App生态及同城即时配送的履约能力。此次入局旨在将外卖业务的高频流量转化为医疗场景的用户粘性，通过技术叠加实现业务纵深扩张。尽管AI医疗赛道竞争激烈，但美团凭借独特的履约基础设施，试图在医疗健康管理领域建立差异化竞争壁垒。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软Edge浏览器下月升级管控功能，强制拦截第三方AI并引导至Copilot</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f7974d8b0300cd6534ce38c1aa17cac3.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软计划于下月对企业版Edge浏览器进行重大升级，旨在通过技术手段强化企业内部AI工具的合规化管理，严防“影子AI”带来的数据安全风险。根据Microsoft 365路线图，IT管理员将获得更高配置权限，可一键屏蔽包括ChatGPT、Google Gemini、Qwen、DeepSeek、Adobe Firefly、Grok及Notion AI在内的数十款主流第三方AI平台。当员工尝试访问未获授权的AI服务时，系统将自动拦截并提供引导按钮，强制用户跳转至企业配置的Microsoft 365 Copilot页面。微软表示，此举旨在消除企业AI应用的数据安全盲区，确保办公流量流向具备租户隔离和数据不外练等企业级保护机制的官方合规通道，从而巩固其在办公场景下的AI生态地位。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Adobe发布Firefly AI Assistant创作智能体，实现跨应用自主工作流调度</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ea0e3079ea88ac5b4bb5040949d6bae6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">4月15日，Adobe正式推出Firefly AI Assistant，这是一款具备自主决策能力的创作智能体，旨在重构Creative Cloud的创作工作流。该工具的核心优势在于跨应用自主执行能力，用户通过自然语言描述目标，Firefly AI Assistant即可独立规划并编排操作流程，在Photoshop、Premiere等多款核心应用间统一调度，无需用户手动切换。此外，该智能体具备个性化学习功能，能记忆用户操作偏好以保持风格一致，并集成了审阅功能以优化交付流程。目前该产品尚未正式公测，Beta测试者预计在未来几周内获得访问权限。对于Adobe全家桶的重度用户而言，这意味着创作模式正从辅助工具向全流程接管转变，将显著降低多软件协作的摩擦成本，提升复杂项目的执行效率。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
